58
00:02:14,440 --> 00:02:19,450
EPISODE 41:
THE FEARSOME DARK HORSE

59
00:02:16,150 --> 00:02:18,400
Nankatsu is last year's champion

60
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:20,610
and they're aiming for their third victory.

61
00:02:20,610 --> 00:02:23,410
Today they're using their usual starting members.

62
00:02:23,410 --> 00:02:25,510
Their opponent Hirado has won

63
00:02:25,510 --> 00:02:27,620
all their matches so far with a 1-0 score.

64
00:02:27,620 --> 00:02:30,170
Even though they haven't scored many goals, Hirado

65
00:02:30,170 --> 00:02:32,720
is known for their strong defense.

66
00:02:32,720 --> 00:02:34,880
How will they handle the champion Nankatsu

67
00:02:34,880 --> 00:02:37,050
and their furious attacks?

68
00:02:37,050 --> 00:02:39,550
These are the outlines of the match.

69
00:02:39,550 --> 00:02:44,640
The game for the last spot in the top four begins now!

70
00:02:46,210 --> 00:02:50,140
When the whistle blows, center forward Sano swiftly advances down the field.

71
00:02:53,620 --> 00:02:57,490
Hirado passes the ball around and rotates it on their side,

72
00:02:57,490 --> 00:03:01,070
carefully waiting for the time to attack.

73
00:03:01,070 --> 00:03:03,500
What does this mean? So they won't come?

74
00:03:03,500 --> 00:03:05,620
Then we must go!

75
00:03:06,220 --> 00:03:09,500
Taki from Nankatsu quickly stole the ball!

76
00:03:09,500 --> 00:03:11,020
Alright!

77
00:03:13,330 --> 00:03:14,590
I'll get through!

78
00:03:17,380 --> 00:03:18,090
Taki!

79
00:03:18,090 --> 00:03:20,990
Taki tried to get past him, but he went

80
00:03:20,990 --> 00:03:23,930
too fast and crashed into Jito's giant body.

81
00:03:23,930 --> 00:03:25,750
Alright, I should show you Hirado's true

82
00:03:25,750 --> 00:03:27,560
power, you know!

83
00:03:28,610 --> 00:03:31,090
Watch out, Morisaki! He's going to shoot!

84
00:03:31,090 --> 00:03:31,600
What—

85
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:36,520
Take this!

86
00:03:37,410 --> 00:03:38,920
Jito surprises us!

87
00:03:38,920 --> 00:03:42,740
He recklessly takes a long shot from the center line!

88
00:03:42,740 --> 00:03:43,660
What?!

89
00:03:43,660 --> 00:03:46,030
That kick is really powerful.

90
00:03:46,030 --> 00:03:48,910
The rocket ball approaches Nankatsu's goal.

91
00:03:48,910 --> 00:03:49,910
Morisaki!

92
00:03:49,910 --> 00:03:51,910
Alright, I can take this!

93
00:03:54,580 --> 00:03:55,210
What?!

94
00:03:56,210 --> 00:03:59,300
This... Goal!

95
00:04:01,050 --> 00:04:03,750
Sano jumped sideways in front of the goal and

96
00:04:03,750 --> 00:04:06,470
redirected Jito's shot to score!

97
00:04:06,470 --> 00:04:09,180
Hirado scored the first goal in the blink of an eye!

98
00:04:09,180 --> 00:04:11,860
In this tournament, Hirado is considered the second

99
00:04:11,860 --> 00:04:14,520
dark horse right after Minamiuwa.

100
00:04:18,070 --> 00:04:20,870
This is my and Sano's combination play, you know!

101
00:04:20,870 --> 00:04:26,110
Even the champion Nankatsu fell for such a cheap trick.

102
00:04:27,850 --> 00:04:29,760
Damn it...

103
00:04:29,760 --> 00:04:31,910
The game has just begun.

104
00:04:31,910 --> 00:04:34,660
If they get a point on us, we have to get it right back.

105
00:04:34,660 --> 00:04:36,250
Tsubasa!

106
00:04:36,250 --> 00:04:38,250
It was just a lucky shot!

107
00:04:38,250 --> 00:04:39,520
Never mind!

108
00:04:39,520 --> 00:04:42,470
You can never catch up to a team like this!

109
00:04:43,790 --> 00:04:45,470
Let's get back in the air and come back!

110
00:04:45,470 --> 00:04:46,770
Tsubasa is right!

111
00:04:46,770 --> 00:04:48,680
If they score, we'll hit back immediately!

112
00:04:49,500 --> 00:04:52,680
I, Great Jito, won't let you
score even a single goal!

113
00:04:54,190 --> 00:04:55,350
Watch out, Kisugi!

114
00:04:56,300 --> 00:04:58,600
What incredible power!

115
00:04:58,600 --> 00:05:01,400
Jito overwhelms Kisugi with immense strength

116
00:05:01,400 --> 00:05:04,150
and steals the ball from his foot!

117
00:05:04,150 --> 00:05:07,520
However, Tsubasa is here to pick up the loose ball.

118
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:09,580
Alright. First, let's score the equalizer!

119
00:05:13,200 --> 00:05:15,330
Noda approaches from the front line.

120
00:05:18,290 --> 00:05:19,380
Now!

121
00:05:19,380 --> 00:05:23,090
Taste my powerful defense!

122
00:05:25,010 --> 00:05:25,760
Tsubasa!

123
00:05:25,760 --> 00:05:26,760
Tsubasa-kun!

124
00:05:26,760 --> 00:05:29,600
This is bad! If his shoulder is hit that hard...

125
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:33,770
Jito gets the ball and keeps advancing.

126
00:05:33,770 --> 00:05:35,320
His violent charge makes him look like

127
00:05:35,320 --> 00:05:36,820
a speeding eighteen-wheeler.

128
00:05:36,820 --> 00:05:38,520
I'm coming for the second goal, you know!

129
00:05:38,520 --> 00:05:39,650
Damn it!

130
00:05:39,650 --> 00:05:42,070
Little tricks don't work on me, you know!

131
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:45,780
He flew up like a small car colliding

132
00:05:45,780 --> 00:05:48,070
with an eighteen-wheeler!

133
00:05:48,070 --> 00:05:50,780
It's unbelievable that even a sliding tackle
has no effect on him...!

134
00:05:50,780 --> 00:05:54,160
His destructive power is even stronger than Hyuga's dribbling.

135
00:05:54,500 --> 00:05:56,330
Jito...

136
00:05:56,330 --> 00:05:57,950
It doesn't matter which one of us gets it!

137
00:05:57,950 --> 00:05:59,080
Hurry up and stop him!

138
00:05:59,080 --> 00:06:02,920
Let me shoot before that, you know!

139
00:06:04,460 --> 00:06:09,720
Jito takes a long shot from the center line!

140
00:06:11,050 --> 00:06:14,160
Did you think we'd fall for the same trick again?!

141
00:06:14,160 --> 00:06:16,600
Don't treat us like fools!

142
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:18,800
Nankatsu's daring Ishizaki

143
00:06:18,800 --> 00:06:21,060
blocks the shot with his face!

144
00:06:21,060 --> 00:06:22,980
Nice, Ishizaki!

145
00:06:26,880 --> 00:06:29,730
Our captain seems to be slowly getting serious.

146
00:06:29,730 --> 00:06:32,240
Maybe I should get serious too.

147
00:06:32,660 --> 00:06:35,240
What do you mean by "getting serious", punk?!

148
00:06:37,790 --> 00:06:39,320
Protect Ishizaki!

149
00:06:39,320 --> 00:06:40,170
Okay!

150
00:06:43,290 --> 00:06:44,380
But he...

151
00:06:44,500 --> 00:06:47,170
Even 3 players can't stop him!

152
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:50,760
Everyone, Jito is coming!

153
00:06:52,940 --> 00:06:54,680
Should you really be looking away?

154
00:06:56,060 --> 00:06:57,810
This is bad! Don't let him shoot!

155
00:06:59,610 --> 00:07:00,690
What?!

156
00:07:00,690 --> 00:07:02,940
Sano gets in front of his opponents and passes!

157
00:07:02,940 --> 00:07:06,480
Still, Nankatsu didn't leave Jito completely alone.

158
00:07:07,380 --> 00:07:08,960
Don't you get it?

159
00:07:08,960 --> 00:07:11,240
Even if little punks like you follow me,

160
00:07:12,320 --> 00:07:13,700
it's no use...

161
00:07:13,700 --> 00:07:14,950
You know!

162
00:07:16,650 --> 00:07:20,330
Jito ignores his marker and takes a powerful shot!

163
00:07:21,750 --> 00:07:24,590
This time, it's a powerful shot from close range!

164
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:29,890
He caught it! Morisaki uses his whole body
to catch the ball tightly!

165
00:07:29,890 --> 00:07:31,340
Well done, Morisaki!

166
00:07:38,580 --> 00:07:42,810
What was that? The goalkeeper flew towards the goal!

167
00:07:42,810 --> 00:07:44,130
What?!

168
00:07:44,130 --> 00:07:45,060
Morisaki!

169
00:07:45,060 --> 00:07:47,480
What incredible power!

170
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:49,730
What incredible destructive force!

171
00:07:49,730 --> 00:07:51,880
Hirado scored another goal thanks to

172
00:07:51,880 --> 00:07:53,990
Captain Jito's powerful shot.

173
00:07:55,220 --> 00:07:58,700
Even though it seems like their first tournament,

174
00:07:58,700 --> 00:08:01,830
Hirado scores two goals against the Champion Nankatsu!

175
00:08:01,830 --> 00:08:05,130
Nankatsu has never been in a difficult situation

176
00:08:05,130 --> 00:08:08,460
where they were behind by two goals from the start.

177
00:08:08,460 --> 00:08:12,260
Is this a yellow light on their road to a third consecutive victory?

178
00:08:12,260 --> 00:08:14,670
This second goal was a hard blow.

179
00:08:14,670 --> 00:08:15,260
What—

180
00:08:16,150 --> 00:08:17,760
Hirado's second goal came from a surprising combo play

181
00:08:17,760 --> 00:08:19,370
by Jito and Sano,

182
00:08:19,370 --> 00:08:22,810
a style that combines power and finesse, hidden until now.

183
00:08:22,810 --> 00:08:25,690
Especially among them, captain Jito displayed a destructive power

184
00:08:25,690 --> 00:08:28,570
surpassing any middle school student,

185
00:08:28,570 --> 00:08:31,000
and showed a huge impact against their opponent,

186
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:33,400
the champion Nankatsu.

187
00:08:33,400 --> 00:08:35,930
Hirado is literally a dark horse!

188
00:08:35,930 --> 00:08:38,490
They were hiding their fearsome fangs.

189
00:08:38,490 --> 00:08:40,060
Did you see that, Nankatsu?

190
00:08:40,060 --> 00:08:42,000
This is Hirado's true power!

191
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:45,040
This is the Hirado we call the Giant Killer.

192
00:08:45,040 --> 00:08:46,070
What...?

193
00:08:46,070 --> 00:08:49,090
They acted like this in Kyushu during the preliminaries in Nagasaki.

194
00:08:49,740 --> 00:08:53,690
It was Hirado that defeated the overwhelming favorite

195
00:08:53,690 --> 00:08:57,640
Saikai MS 6-0 in the final.

196
00:08:57,640 --> 00:09:01,140
Hirado was lax in their matches, but for this match

197
00:09:01,140 --> 00:09:04,640
they unveiled their incredible power.

198
00:09:04,690 --> 00:09:09,940
So, Hirado won all their matches so far 1-0...

199
00:09:09,940 --> 00:09:12,450
For them, none of their opponents were worth

200
00:09:12,450 --> 00:09:14,960
showing their true offensive power.

201
00:09:15,700 --> 00:09:18,020
The higher the level of their opponents,

202
00:09:18,020 --> 00:09:20,320
the stronger Hirado MS becomes.

203
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:26,700
And as their opponents get stronger, Hiroshi Jito gets even more fired up.

204
00:09:26,700 --> 00:09:29,070
Come on, Nankatsu.

205
00:09:29,070 --> 00:09:32,770
It won't be fun at all if the game ends like this.

206
00:09:32,770 --> 00:09:33,630
What?

207
00:09:33,630 --> 00:09:36,930
If you're not even showing some guts,

208
00:09:36,930 --> 00:09:41,200
I won't see why I came all the way
from Kyushu, you know?

209
00:09:44,200 --> 00:09:46,770
Damn it. Just watch, Jito!

210
00:09:49,790 --> 00:09:54,790
~Anime Lovers~
Instagram: AnimeSeverlerrr

211
00:09:55,200 --> 00:10:00,950
Hirado MS has lifted the mysterious veil
behind which they hid their fearsome power.

212
00:10:00,950 --> 00:10:04,750
Right now, Champion Nankatsu aims
to close the two-goal gap.

213
00:10:04,750 --> 00:10:06,750
Cheering is the most important thing when you're behind!

214
00:10:06,750 --> 00:10:08,690
Everyone, shout loudly!

215
00:10:08,690 --> 00:10:09,590
Okay!

216
00:10:09,590 --> 00:10:11,620
Don't underestimate Nankatsu!

217
00:10:11,620 --> 00:10:14,420
You are not the ones who will lose here!

218
00:10:14,420 --> 00:10:16,130
Right.

219
00:10:16,130 --> 00:10:17,420
How could we...

220
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:20,220
How could we lose here?!

221
00:10:21,650 --> 00:10:23,010
Let's go, everyone!

222
00:10:23,010 --> 00:10:23,850
Yeah!

223
00:10:23,850 --> 00:10:26,020
Oh, Hirado MS filled the center of the field

224
00:10:26,020 --> 00:10:28,190
and tightened their defense!

225
00:10:28,190 --> 00:10:30,300
So they'll really focus on their defense...

226
00:10:30,300 --> 00:10:31,190
Huh?

227
00:10:31,190 --> 00:10:35,400
Hirado didn't concede any points to their opponents
and allowed zero goals in this tournament.

228
00:10:35,400 --> 00:10:38,780
This shows how confident they are in defense.

229
00:10:38,780 --> 00:10:42,490
I said that being 2 goals ahead is a
tremendous blow.

230
00:10:42,490 --> 00:10:44,460
Alright, here we go!

231
00:10:45,240 --> 00:10:48,580
On Nankatsu's side, Taki and
Kisugi's movements are a bit heavy.

232
00:10:48,580 --> 00:10:52,290
Did they injure themselves in their encounters with Jito?

233
00:10:52,290 --> 00:10:53,880
Kisugi! Taki!

234
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:56,630
My shoulder is injured too!

235
00:10:56,630 --> 00:10:57,880
That's it.

236
00:10:57,880 --> 00:11:00,610
Go! Crush Tsubasa!

237
00:11:00,610 --> 00:11:01,640
Yes!

238
00:11:03,970 --> 00:11:04,810
Damn it!

239
00:11:05,430 --> 00:11:07,730
Tsubasa slips away!

240
00:11:07,730 --> 00:11:08,310
Izawa!

241
00:11:09,160 --> 00:11:09,730
Here!

242
00:11:09,730 --> 00:11:10,770
They did it!

243
00:11:10,770 --> 00:11:13,850
A beautiful one-two pass between Tsubasa and Izawa.

244
00:11:13,850 --> 00:11:15,360
Izawa, get in front of the goal!

245
00:11:15,360 --> 00:11:16,190
Of course!

246
00:11:16,190 --> 00:11:20,030
Tsubasa dribbles down the sideline, which is rare for him.

247
00:11:20,030 --> 00:11:22,760
Hatayama, I trust you for number 8.

248
00:11:22,760 --> 00:11:24,590
I'll hold the other guy, you know.

249
00:11:24,590 --> 00:11:25,370
Of course.

250
00:11:26,560 --> 00:11:27,710
Here we go!

251
00:11:27,710 --> 00:11:30,040
Tsubasa sends a cross in front of the goal!

252
00:11:30,040 --> 00:11:33,630
Is he sending the ball to Izawa, known for his heading skills?

253
00:11:34,880 --> 00:11:35,880
What?!

254
00:11:35,880 --> 00:11:36,460
Alright!

255
00:11:37,340 --> 00:11:39,360
Izawa was a decoy!

256
00:11:39,360 --> 00:11:42,300
A perfect cross for Nagano!

257
00:11:42,300 --> 00:11:43,300
Okay, I got it!

258
00:11:43,300 --> 00:11:44,800
I won't let you, you know!

259
00:11:44,800 --> 00:11:48,170
But Jito stopped Nagano.

260
00:11:48,170 --> 00:11:50,060
Nankatsu couldn't score!

261
00:11:50,060 --> 00:11:52,270
Takeno picks up the loose ball.

262
00:11:52,270 --> 00:11:53,940
He sends a long pass forward!

263
00:11:54,430 --> 00:11:56,640
It reaches Sano!

264
00:11:57,270 --> 00:11:58,780
Everyone, please, stop him!

265
00:11:58,780 --> 00:12:00,900
Leave it to me!

266
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:08,500
We, Nankatsu defenders, are not the kind of people

267
00:12:08,500 --> 00:12:10,910
you can beat again and again with the same thing!

268
00:12:10,910 --> 00:12:12,290
Nice, Takasugi!

269
00:12:12,290 --> 00:12:15,120
Nankatsu refuses to concede any more goals!

270
00:12:15,120 --> 00:12:16,790
Takasugi keeps advancing.

271
00:12:16,790 --> 00:12:19,300
But Jito comes to confront him!

272
00:12:19,300 --> 00:12:20,470
Here I come, Jito!

273
00:12:20,470 --> 00:12:21,980
I won't lose in a power struggle!

274
00:12:23,880 --> 00:12:26,800
A clash between two giant opponents!

275
00:12:32,820 --> 00:12:37,610
Nankatsu, even with Takasugi's strength, cannot get past Jito!

276
00:12:38,970 --> 00:12:40,000
What?!

277
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:43,610
Ah, Jito lost the ball for the first time in this match.

278
00:12:43,610 --> 00:12:47,130
They stole the ball from the Captain.

279
00:12:47,130 --> 00:12:47,620
Heh.

280
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:50,830
It wouldn't be interesting otherwise, you know.

281
00:12:52,860 --> 00:12:55,500
Tsubasa, despite his injured shoulder, is working hard.

282
00:12:55,500 --> 00:12:57,080
At least we can do this!

283
00:12:57,080 --> 00:12:59,460
Send it here, Tsubasa!

284
00:12:59,460 --> 00:13:01,710
Send it to us!

285
00:13:02,800 --> 00:13:04,840
Alright, I'm counting on you!

286
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:06,890
Let's go!

287
00:13:08,040 --> 00:13:09,510
Kisugi!

288
00:13:12,140 --> 00:13:14,180
Kisugi couldn't catch the ball.

289
00:13:14,180 --> 00:13:17,100
Hirado easily controlled the ball.

290
00:13:17,100 --> 00:13:20,200
Instead of Kisugi and Taki, as the Shutetsu trio's

291
00:13:20,200 --> 00:13:23,280
Mamoru Izawa, I'll pay it back!

292
00:13:24,330 --> 00:13:26,410
Izawa stole the ball back!

293
00:13:26,410 --> 00:13:28,620
The match continues to switch between attack and defense.

294
00:13:28,620 --> 00:13:30,530
As if we'll let you go further!

295
00:13:31,780 --> 00:13:32,620
Damn it!

296
00:13:32,620 --> 00:13:34,750
The ball got away from Izawa.

297
00:13:34,750 --> 00:13:37,440
Tsubasa quickly recovered it.

298
00:13:37,440 --> 00:13:39,380
Alright, here's the first goal!

299
00:13:39,380 --> 00:13:42,000
I won't concede even a single goal!

300
00:13:43,500 --> 00:13:46,970
Tsubasa took the shot just in time!

301
00:13:52,250 --> 00:13:54,980
His shot hit the post!

302
00:13:54,980 --> 00:13:55,980
What?!

303
00:13:57,080 --> 00:13:57,900
What bad luck!

304
00:13:57,900 --> 00:13:59,690
Nankatsu couldn't score.

305
00:13:59,690 --> 00:14:02,410
Also, it seems that Tsubasa's injured left shoulder

306
00:14:02,410 --> 00:14:05,110
was hit hard.

307
00:14:05,110 --> 00:14:06,360
Tsubasa-kun!

308
00:14:06,360 --> 00:14:07,650
Tsubasa senpai!

309
00:14:07,650 --> 00:14:09,930
At the moment he kicked the ball, he tried

310
00:14:09,930 --> 00:14:12,230
to protect his shoulder from Jito's charge.

311
00:14:12,230 --> 00:14:15,750
Because of that, even though there was a slight change, his shot spun.

312
00:14:16,780 --> 00:14:18,120
Here, I'm sending it!

313
00:14:18,120 --> 00:14:20,880
Hirado launched a counter-attack.

314
00:14:20,880 --> 00:14:22,500
Everyone, get back immediately!

315
00:14:23,570 --> 00:14:24,840
Tsubasa!

316
00:14:24,840 --> 00:14:27,630
Tsubasa is in pain and cannot stand.

317
00:14:27,630 --> 00:14:30,300
Hirado is making advantageous and harsh attacks!

318
00:14:30,300 --> 00:14:33,340
Kisugi, we'll strengthen the defense and compensate for our mistakes!

319
00:14:33,340 --> 00:14:34,310
Okay!

320
00:14:34,310 --> 00:14:36,880
The two forwards Taki and Kisugi desperately

321
00:14:36,880 --> 00:14:39,440
chase after Hirado to block the attack.

322
00:14:39,440 --> 00:14:43,980
Meanwhile, Sano was held by Nakazato and Ishizaki.

323
00:14:46,440 --> 00:14:50,280
Hirado stalls in the center of the field and looks for an opening.

324
00:14:50,690 --> 00:14:52,070
Damn it!

325
00:14:52,070 --> 00:14:53,180
Tsubasa-kun.

326
00:14:53,180 --> 00:14:54,390
Tsubasa-kun.

327
00:14:54,390 --> 00:14:55,830
Tsubasa senpai!

328
00:14:55,830 --> 00:14:58,180
Both teams reach a stalemate

329
00:14:58,180 --> 00:15:00,540
in the last 5 minutes of the first half.

330
00:15:01,130 --> 00:15:03,920
I think it's time for me to deliver the finishing blow.

331
00:15:03,920 --> 00:15:05,880
Send it to me, you know!

332
00:15:05,880 --> 00:15:06,710
Jito!

333
00:15:08,800 --> 00:15:11,530
They're going to do a combination play again!

334
00:15:11,530 --> 00:15:13,940
Don't let Sano get free!

335
00:15:13,940 --> 00:15:15,060
Okay!

336
00:15:17,460 --> 00:15:20,440
Sorry, but with this, it'll be the third goal in the first half!

337
00:15:20,440 --> 00:15:23,720
The legend of champion Nankatsu will be crushed

338
00:15:23,720 --> 00:15:27,010
by the great Hiroshi Jito, you know!

339
00:15:29,780 --> 00:15:32,500
Did he perhaps not hit the ball properly?

340
00:15:32,500 --> 00:15:34,030
The ball doesn't have its usual power.

341
00:15:35,830 --> 00:15:37,200
This spin...

342
00:15:37,200 --> 00:15:39,100
Goalkeeper Morisaki comes out to catch the ball

343
00:15:39,100 --> 00:15:40,960
after its first bounce!

344
00:15:40,960 --> 00:15:42,420
That's enough!

345
00:15:44,750 --> 00:15:49,050
Jito apparently added a lot of backspin to that ball!

346
00:15:49,050 --> 00:15:49,970
What?!

347
00:15:53,890 --> 00:15:57,340
Sano's volley shot, synchronized with Jito's backspin pass,

348
00:15:57,340 --> 00:16:00,850
gave Hirado a third goal!

349
00:16:01,760 --> 00:16:08,860
Champion Nankatsu is behind by three goals in the first half!

350
00:16:08,860 --> 00:16:09,590
You did it!

351
00:16:09,590 --> 00:16:10,840
Jito! Sano!

352
00:16:10,840 --> 00:16:12,610
We've taken this match!

353
00:16:14,120 --> 00:16:15,360
Nankatsu...

354
00:16:15,360 --> 00:16:16,870
Tsubasa...

355
00:16:16,870 --> 00:16:17,780
Will he lose?

356
00:16:22,410 --> 00:16:25,300
This truly was a huge blow for them.

357
00:16:25,300 --> 00:16:28,120
Was it a challenging goal filled with injuries

358
00:16:28,120 --> 00:16:30,920
on the way for Nankatsu to achieve V3 and become a legend?

359
00:16:32,290 --> 00:16:35,720
I guess that's all for football.

360
00:16:36,250 --> 00:16:38,620
This is very boring, you know.

361
00:16:40,770 --> 00:16:43,160
Useless.

362
00:16:43,160 --> 00:16:44,390
I can't win.

363
00:16:46,650 --> 00:16:50,850
Wakabayashi-kun, our V3 now seems like an impossible mission.

364
00:16:51,810 --> 00:16:55,070
Misaki-kun, I wish you were here...

365
00:16:56,360 --> 00:16:58,390
Sorry, Roberto.

366
00:16:58,390 --> 00:17:00,660
After all, I think I'll lose.

367
00:17:03,660 --> 00:17:05,210
Tsubasa?

368
00:17:05,790 --> 00:17:06,920
Tsubasa-kun!

369
00:17:06,920 --> 00:17:08,600
What's wrong, Tsubasa?!

370
00:17:08,600 --> 00:17:09,770
Tsubasa!

371
00:17:10,920 --> 00:17:13,920
Tsubasa...!

372
00:17:16,280 --> 00:17:17,960
What's the matter, Tsubasa?

373
00:17:25,350 --> 00:17:27,980
Since when have you been such a coward?

374
00:17:27,980 --> 00:17:30,770
They may be three goals ahead, but it's only the first half.

375
00:17:30,770 --> 00:17:33,110
Are you going to give up on the match this early?

376
00:17:33,110 --> 00:17:35,390
He's right, Tsubasa-kun.

377
00:17:35,390 --> 00:17:38,130
You can combine your game with any of your teammates.

378
00:17:38,130 --> 00:17:41,180
Isn't Nankatsu such a well-established team?

379
00:17:41,180 --> 00:17:45,120
And yet, are you going to give up all alone
here, Tsubasa-kun?

380
00:17:45,120 --> 00:17:47,250
Misaki-kun...

381
00:17:47,250 --> 00:17:49,150
Wakabayashi-kun...

382
00:17:49,150 --> 00:17:51,130
Tsubasa, don't give up!

383
00:17:51,820 --> 00:17:53,380
Use the Drive Shot.

384
00:17:51,820 --> 00:17:53,380
Drive Shot

385
00:17:53,380 --> 00:17:55,130
You've got it.

386
00:17:55,130 --> 00:18:01,140
Use that dream-like Drive Shot I left behind
and taught you.

387
00:18:01,140 --> 00:18:03,290
Roberto...

388
00:18:03,290 --> 00:18:04,930
Drive Shot...

389
00:18:03,290 --> 00:18:04,930
Drive Shot

390
00:18:12,220 --> 00:18:13,170
Tsubasa!

391
00:18:13,170 --> 00:18:14,630
Pull yourself together, Tsubasa!

392
00:18:14,630 --> 00:18:15,340
Tsubasa!

393
00:18:15,340 --> 00:18:16,400
Tsubasa!

394
00:18:16,400 --> 00:18:17,450
Tsubasa!

395
00:18:17,450 --> 00:18:18,910
Hey, are you okay?

396
00:18:18,910 --> 00:18:19,860
Stretcher.

397
00:18:19,860 --> 00:18:21,200
Bring the stretcher, quickly!

398
00:18:21,200 --> 00:18:22,840
It's fine.

399
00:18:22,840 --> 00:18:25,410
I'm fine.

400
00:18:26,100 --> 00:18:27,900
Tsubasa...

401
00:18:27,900 --> 00:18:30,060
Are you really okay?

402
00:18:30,060 --> 00:18:30,920
Yes.

403
00:18:30,920 --> 00:18:33,860
Hah, the outcome of this match is already decided, you know.

404
00:18:33,860 --> 00:18:36,190
Why don't you go to sleep, you know?

405
00:18:36,190 --> 00:18:38,110
What...?!

406
00:18:42,680 --> 00:18:45,140
The first half ends here!

407
00:18:45,140 --> 00:18:49,140
Nankatsu is behind by three goals.

408
00:18:49,140 --> 00:18:54,050
Nankatsu's third consecutive championship
is definitely in danger.

409
00:18:54,050 --> 00:18:56,610
They are truly in a hopeless situation.

410
00:18:56,610 --> 00:18:58,860
HIRADO MIDDLE SCHOOL
NAGASAKI REPRESENTATIVE

411
00:18:57,790 --> 00:18:58,860
We did it, everyone!

412
00:18:59,360 --> 00:19:00,440
This is great!

413
00:19:00,440 --> 00:19:02,880
We scored three goals against Nankatsu.

414
00:19:02,880 --> 00:19:05,830
If we keep this up, we can score even more!

415
00:19:05,830 --> 00:19:08,610
We're counting on you in the second half too, guys, Jito, Sano.

416
00:19:08,610 --> 00:19:09,860
That's enough.

417
00:19:09,860 --> 00:19:13,940
We'll go 0-0 in the second half, preparing
ourselves for tomorrow, you know.

418
00:19:13,940 --> 00:19:14,750
Huh?

419
00:19:22,280 --> 00:19:23,540
Captain.

420
00:19:23,540 --> 00:19:25,180
Is that you, Sano?

421
00:19:25,180 --> 00:19:27,770
The teacher was complaining about you.

422
00:19:27,770 --> 00:19:30,290
If only you took things seriously, we'd be so

423
00:19:30,290 --> 00:19:32,810
strong that no one would recognize us at first.

424
00:19:32,810 --> 00:19:36,720
Hah! They threw the captain title onto me, you know.

425
00:19:36,720 --> 00:19:40,120
I wasn't really interested in football anyway.

426
00:19:40,120 --> 00:19:43,000
Is that why you skipped school and got into fights?

427
00:19:43,000 --> 00:19:44,450
Well, yeah.

428
00:19:45,310 --> 00:19:49,840
High school students these days are so weird, boring, you know.

429
00:19:49,840 --> 00:19:53,260
I wonder if there are stronger guys
somewhere out there.

430
00:19:53,260 --> 00:19:54,310
There is one.

431
00:19:54,310 --> 00:19:54,960
Hmm?

432
00:19:55,530 --> 00:19:57,920
He's the strongest guy right now.

433
00:19:58,400 --> 00:20:00,500
He's Nankatsu's captain, who led his team to the

434
00:20:00,500 --> 00:20:02,590
National Tournament championship twice.

435
00:20:02,590 --> 00:20:04,930
Still, he's strong in football rather than fighting.

436
00:20:04,930 --> 00:20:08,240
Sano, is this guy really that strong?!

437
00:20:08,240 --> 00:20:11,740
Yes, football club members from all over the country

438
00:20:11,740 --> 00:20:15,230
aim to defeat Tsubasa Ozora.

439
00:20:15,230 --> 00:20:16,690
Oooh.

440
00:20:22,000 --> 00:20:24,590
Practicing is very bothersome.

441
00:20:24,590 --> 00:20:24,870
Huh?

442
00:20:25,530 --> 00:20:30,230
However, defeating the strong is my hobby.

443
00:20:30,230 --> 00:20:31,750
Shall we give it a try?

444
00:20:32,260 --> 00:20:33,440
Captain...

445
00:20:34,730 --> 00:20:36,130
Of course!

446
00:20:37,240 --> 00:20:44,360
The first opponent I took seriously was Nankatsu and Tsubasa Ozora.

447
00:20:44,360 --> 00:20:47,680
To think that beating them would be so easy...

448
00:20:48,890 --> 00:20:53,360
I guess, after all, there's no one stronger than me.

449
00:20:51,180 --> 00:20:54,190
INFIRMARY

450
00:20:54,190 --> 00:20:55,760
Three goals behind, huh?

451
00:20:55,760 --> 00:20:57,700
That's a big problem for you.

452
00:20:57,700 --> 00:21:00,160
I suppose even someone like you is thinking of giving up.

453
00:21:00,160 --> 00:21:01,110
No.

454
00:21:01,110 --> 00:21:03,990
I have the ability to combine with anyone,

455
00:21:03,990 --> 00:21:06,940
and most importantly, I have the Drive Shot

456
00:21:06,940 --> 00:21:09,870
that I haven't used even once in this match.

457
00:21:09,870 --> 00:21:13,370
I will definitely not give up!

458
00:21:14,750 --> 00:21:16,750
Tsubasa-kun.

459
00:21:16,750 --> 00:21:19,660
Taki and Kisugi, are you two okay?

460
00:21:19,660 --> 00:21:21,870
We just have bruises.

461
00:21:21,870 --> 00:21:23,750
But Tsubasa...

462
00:21:26,340 --> 00:21:28,180
Tsubasa!

463
00:21:28,180 --> 00:21:29,680
Now, let's go, everyone.

464
00:21:30,130 --> 00:21:31,260
It's time for the second half!

465
00:21:31,800 --> 00:21:33,140
Tsubasa!

466
00:21:33,140 --> 00:21:34,270
Y-Yes!

467
00:21:34,270 --> 00:21:36,900
Right, we still have to do our best!

468
00:21:36,900 --> 00:21:39,480
We can't do anything about these three goals now.

469
00:21:39,480 --> 00:21:41,270
Alright everyone, let's do it!

470
00:21:41,270 --> 00:21:45,000
He just smiled and everyone's eagerness returned.

471
00:21:45,000 --> 00:21:46,900
I guess we have no choice but to trust Tsubasa

472
00:21:46,900 --> 00:21:48,780
whether he's injured or not.

473
00:21:50,060 --> 00:21:52,580
The second half is about to begin.

474
00:21:52,580 --> 00:21:55,990
Nankatsu's Captain Tsubasa, whose health

475
00:21:55,990 --> 00:21:57,960
is worrying, is also ready to start the half.

476
00:21:58,370 --> 00:21:59,750
Oh man.

477
00:21:59,750 --> 00:22:02,660
Izawa, give me the ball quickly.

478
00:22:02,660 --> 00:22:03,560
Huh?

479
00:22:03,560 --> 00:22:06,420
I'm going to score a goal right away.

480
00:22:09,610 --> 00:22:11,510
Here I come, Hirado.

481
00:22:11,510 --> 00:22:17,960
You'll be the first to taste my Drive Shot!

482
